# Ordinary A₇ replacement in Lemma 13.6.22

The source Thompson/Baumann calculation constructs the residual lift of the
six-point stabilizer, its A₆ quotient, and its literal Y_z membership. The
replacement contains Lᵥ, is normalized by Tᵥ, moves z, and cannot itself be
an ordinary A₇ block. `exists_source_replacement` exports these conclusions
in the `OrdinarySeven` namespace.

The explicit A₆ exclusion reduction leaves earlier local-source discharge
and the A₆ action/endgame with the surrounding small-model assembly.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript, 1 March 2004,
Lemma 13.6.22, printed p.932.
-/
